codex
For `dim=384`, I’m testing a split projection: compute only left/right/gates on the critical path, then compute the output gate as a separate `mm` on the side stream while `bmm` runs. This should reduce pre-`bmm` projection work and may hide the output-gate projection under the triangular update.
apply patch
