codex
The fused final projection is Triton dot-heavy. I’m testing an alternative for `dim=384`: Triton only normalizes/applies the gate into an H-contiguous buffer, then cuBLAS performs the final `[rows,128] x [128,D]` projection. This adds a buffer but may use tensor cores more efficiently.
apply patch
