codex
The buffer cache currently keeps only one shape at a time. If the blackbox interleaves shapes, that causes repeated large allocations. I’m testing a multi-shape buffer cache keyed by shape, name, and dtype; memory use should still be reasonable on an 80GB A100/A800.
apply patch
